    "assetCatalog": {
      "Ability§Aetherstride (psychic)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Movement phase, when this model is set up on the battlefield using the Deep Strike ability, it can perform an aetherstride. If it does:\n\n* It can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6\" horizontally away from all enemy units.\n\n* Until the end of the turn, its Dark Blessing has the [SUSTAINED HITS D3] ability.\n\n* Until the end of the turn, it is not eligible to declare a charge."
      },
      "Ability§Ahriman": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Special"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Your army cannot contain both Ahriman and Ahriman on Disc of Tzeentch."
      },
      "Ability§Ambushing Hunters": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "At the end of your oppponent's turn, if the unit is more than 6\" horizontally away from all enemy units, you can remove this unit from the battlefield and place it inside Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Ability§Arcane Shield (psychic)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit a 4+ invulnerable save."
      },
      "Ability§Arch-sorcerer of Tzeentch (psychic)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model attempts a Ritual, add 1 to the Psychic test result."
      },
      "Ability§Assault Ramp": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time a unit disembarks from this Transport after it has made a Normal move, that unit is still eligible to declare a charge this turn."
      },
      "Ability§Bestial Prophet": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Binding Tendrils (psychic)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Shooting phase, after this model has shot, select one enemy unit Infantry unit hit by one or more of those attacks made with its Arcane Fire; until the start of your next turn, that enemy unit is ensnared. While a unit is ensnared, subtract 2 from its Move characteristic and subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for it."
      },
      "Ability§Blazing Salvoes": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Shooting phase, after this model has shot, select one enemy unit that was hit by one or more of those attacks. Until the start of your next turn, that enemy unit is suppressed. While a unit is suppressed, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Bringers of Change": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time a model in this unit makes a ranged attack, re-roll a Wound roll of 1. If the target of that attack is within range of an objective marker you do not control, you can re-roll the Wound roll instead."
      },
      "Ability§Cabal of Sorcerers": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [],
          "Keywords": [
            "Faction"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Ability§Cabal of Sorcerers (Army Rule)": {
        "aspects": {
          "Label": "Cabal of Sorcerers"
        },
        "text": "If your Army Faction is THOUSAND SONS, at the start of your Shooting phase, one or more models from your army with this ability can attempt Rituals from those listed. To do so, select one model from your army with this ability that has not yet attempted a Ritual this turn and select one Ritual no model from\nyour army has attempted to manifest this turn, then take a Psychic test for that model by following the sequence below.\n\n---\n\n## PSYCHIC TEST SEQUENCE\n\nRoll 2D6\n\n---\n\n**Channel the Warp**\n(Optional)\n\nAdd 1D6\n\nThen, if one or more doubles or triples were rolled during this test, that model’s unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.\n\n---\nIf that model is not destroyed, the combined total of all the dice rolled during this test is the Psychic test result. If this equals or exceeds the Warp Charge value of the Ritual being attempted, that model manifests that Ritual and you resolve its effects.\n\n---\n\n## DESTINY'S RUIN (PSYCHIC)\nWARP CHARGE - 5\n\n\nSelect one enemy unit within 24” of and visible to the manifesting model. Until the end of the phase, each time a Thousand Sons or Scintillating Legions model from your army makes an attack that targets that unit, re‑roll a Hit roll of 1. If the Psychic test result for this Ritual was 10+, you can re‑roll the Hit roll instead.\n\n---\n\n## TEMPORAL SURGE (PSYCHIC) \nWARP CHARGE - 6\n\nSelect one friendly Thousand Sons or Scintillating Legions unit that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units and is within 24” of and visible to the manifesting model. That unit can make a Normal move of up to D6”. If the Psychic test result for this Ritual was 10+, that unit can make a Normal move of up to 6” instead. In either case, until the end of the turn, that unit is not eligible to declare a charge.\n\n---\n\n## DOOMBOLT (PSYCHIC) \nWARP CHARGE - 7\n\nSelect one enemy unit within 24\" of and visible to the manifesting model (excluding units with the Lone Operative ability that are not part of an Attached unit and are not within 12\" of the manifesting model); that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds. If the Psychic test result for this Ritual was 11+, that unit suffers D3+3 mortal wounds instead.\n\n---\n\n## TWIST OF FATE (PSYCHIC) \nWARP CHARGE - 9\n\nSelect one enemy unit within 24\" of and visible to the manifesting model. Until the end of the phase, each time a Thousand Sons or Scintillating Legions  model from your army makes an attack that targets that unit, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1. If the Psychic test result for this Ritual was 12+, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 2 instead.\n\n---\n\n## PACT OF SORCERY\n\nWhen mustering your army, unless specifically stated otherwise, you cannot select SCINTILLATING LEGIONS as your Army Faction."
      },
