      "Enhancement§Walking Rampart": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Sekhetar Cohort"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 30
          }
        },
        "text": "**SORCERER**/**EXALTED SORCERER** model only. This model has the following abilities:\n\n- **Soul Bound:** In your Movement phase, at the start or end of this unit’s move, you can select one friendly **SEKHETAR ROBOTS** unit within 3\" of this model. That **SEKHETAR ROBOTS** unit **heals** D3+1 wounds.\n\n- **Kine-shielded Guardians:** While this model is within 3\" of a friendly **SEKHETAR ROBOTS** unit, this model has **Lone Operative**.",
        "rules": {
          "SORCERER/EXALTED SORCERER model only.": {
            "evals": [
              {
                "actionable": false,
                "contains": true,
                "not": false,
