      "Stratagem§Arcane Focus": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Grand Coven"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, just after you take a Psychic test for a **THOUSAND SONS** model from your army that Channelled the Warp (before resolving that Ritual).\n\n**TARGET:** That **THOUSAND SONS** model.\n\n**EFFECT:** Re-roll all of the D6 rolled for that Psychic test (including the additional D6 for Channelling the Warp)."
      },
      "Stratagem§Ardent Automata": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Rubricae Phalanx"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after a **RUBRICAE** unit from your army Falls Back.\n\n**TARGET:** That **RUBRICAE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§Blessed Transmutations": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Warpmeld Pact"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** model from your army, and one friendly **TZAANGORS** unit that is below its Starting Strength and within 12\" of that **PSYKER** model.\n\n**EFFECT:** Return up to D3+1 destroyed models (excluding **CHARACTERS**) to your **TZAANGORS** unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Chronosorcerous Bleed": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Changehost of Deceit"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your opponent's Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **unengaged** **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER**/**SCINTILLATING LEGIONS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one **visible** enemy unit within 12\" of your unit. When that enemy unit **declares a charge**, that enemy unit has -1 to **charge rolls**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Cyberspirit Machinations": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Warpforged Cabal"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after a **THOUSAND SONS VEHICLE** unit from your army Falls Back.\n\n**TARGET:** That **VEHICLE** unit, and one friendly **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit within 6\" of that **VEHICLE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your **VEHICLE** unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§Deceptive Glamour": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Changehost of Deceit"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **THOUSAND SONS** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an enemy model within Engagement Range of your unit selects targets for its attacks, it can only target your unit if there are no eligible **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS** targets for those attacks."
      },
      "Stratagem§Deranged Ferocity": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Warpmeld Pact"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after a **TZEENTCH MUTANT** unit from your army is selected to fi ght.\n\n**TARGET:** That **TZEENTCH MUTANT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a Pile-in or Consolidation move, it can move up to 6\" instead of up to 3\", and when determining which models in it are eligible to fight, any models in it that are within 3\" of one or more enemy models are eligible to fight. When resolving those attacks, such models can target one of those enemy units that is within 3\" of them and within Engagement Range of their unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Desecration of Worlds": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Grand Coven"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit from your army within range of an objective marker you control.\n\n**EFFECT:** That objective marker remains under your control until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§Destined by Fate": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Grand Coven"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after a saving throw is failed for a **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** model from your army. If you are using fast dice rolling, this Stratagem can still be used after rolling multiple saving throws at once.\n\n**TARGET:** That **PSYKER** model.\n\n**EFFECT:** Change the Damage characteristic of that attack to 0. If you are using fast dice rolling, select one of those attacks you failed a saving throw for."
      },
      "Stratagem§Devastating Sorcery": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Grand Coven"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, add 9\" to the Range characteristic of Psychic weapons equipped by models in your unit, and each time a model in your unit makes an attack with a Psychic weapon, you can re-roll the Hit roll and you can re-roll the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Egotistical Power": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Grand Coven"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select the Imbued Manifestation, Psychic Maelstrom or Wrath of the Immaterium ability (see Kindred Sorcery). Until the start of your next Command phase, that ability applies to your unit instead of any other Kindred Sorcery ability, even if you have already selected that ability this battle."
      },
      "Stratagem§Ensorcelled Infusion": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Warpforged Cabal"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **THOUSAND SONS VEHICLE** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase, that is within 6\" of one or more friendly **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by **VEHICLE** models in your unit have the **[PSYCHIC]** ability and each time an attack is made with such a weapon, add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Ethereal Phantasm": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Changehost of Deceit"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.\n\n**TARGET:** One **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS** unit from your army that is within 8\" of that enemy unit and not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a Normal move of up to D6\", or a Normal move of up to 6\" instead if it is wholly within 6\" of one or more friendly **THOUSAND SONS** units."
      },
      "Stratagem§Fractal Disjunction": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Changehost of Deceit"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS** unit from your army (excluding **MONSTERS**) that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, your unit can only be selected as the target of a ranged attack if the attacking model is within 18\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Gift of Change": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Warpmeld Pact"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **THOUSAND SONS CHARACTER** model from your army (excluding **MONSTERS**) that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that model even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** At the end of the phase, add one **TZEENTCH CHAOS SPAWN** unit containing one model to your army, and set it up as close as possible to where your model was destroyed and not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You can only use this Stratagem once per battle round."
      },
      "Stratagem§Glimmershift Portal": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Changehost of Deceit"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** Up to two **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS** units from your army (excluding **MONSTERS**), or one **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS MONSTER** unit from your army, if all of those units are more than 3\" horizontally away from all enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove those units from the battlefield and place them into Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Stratagem§Hex-Marked Armour": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Warpforged Cabal"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **THOUSAND SONS VEHICLE** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Implacable Guardians": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Rubricae Phalanx"
          ],
          "Category": [
