          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **RUBRICAE** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit can ignore any or all modifiers to its Move characteristic and to Advance rolls made for it, and ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[ASSAULT]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Infernal Fusillade": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
