        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, all inferno bolt pistols, inferno boltguns, inferno combi-bolters and inferno combi-weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[PSYCHIC]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Kaleidoscopic Tempest": {
        "keywords": {
          "Turn": [
