          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Hexwarp Thrallband"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** ▫ Your unit has **Stealth**.\n▫ If your unit is wholly within your army’s Flow of Magic, your unit has ‐3 **detection range**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Malevolent Animus": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Warpforged Cabal"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase\n\n**TARGET:** One **THOUSAND SONS VEHICLE** unit from your army within 6\" of one or more friendly **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the start of your next Command phase, your **VEHICLE** unit is malevolent. While a unit is malevolent, it can ignore any or all modifiers to the following: the profile characteristics of its models; the Weapon Skill and Ballistic Skill characteristics of weapons equipped by its models; any roll or test made for it (excluding modifiers to saving throws)."
      },
      "Stratagem§Mutate Landscape": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Warpforged Cabal"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit from your army within range of an objective marker you control.\n\n**EFFECT:** That objective marker is mutated, and remains under your control until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase. While an objective marker is mutated and under your control, each time an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance, Fall Back or Charge move within range of that objective marker, roll one D6: on a 4+, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds."
      },
      "Stratagem§Psychic Dominion": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Grand Coven"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **THOUSAND SONS** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, all attacks made against your unit with Psychic weapons have the **[HAZARDOUS]** ability and all models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 4+ ability against Psychic Attacks."
      },
      "Stratagem§Revenge of the Rubricae": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Rubricae Phalanx"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after a **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** model from your army is destroyed.\n\n**TARGET:** One **RUBRICAE** unit from your army that was within 6\" of that **PSYKER** model when it was destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** After the attacking unit has shot, your **RUBRICAE** unit can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, but when resolving those attacks it can only target the enemy unit that just destroyed your **PSYKER** model (and only if it is an eligible target)."
      },
      "Stratagem§Scouring Warpflame": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Hexwarp Thrallband"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase and is wholly within your army’s Flow of Magic.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[IGNORES COVER]** ability. After your unit has shot this phase, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks. Until the end of the phase, models in that unit cannot have the Benefit of Cover."
      },
      "Stratagem§Strands of Time": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Hexwarp Thrallband"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after a **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit from your army Falls Back.\n\n**TARGET:** That **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot or declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back. If your unit is wholly within your army’s Flow of Magic when it is targeted with this Stratagem, then until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§Sulphurous Veil": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Changehost of Deceit"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **THOUSAND SONS** or **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Through the Veil": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Hexwarp Thrallband"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of the Reinforcements step of your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **RUBRIC MARINES** or **SCARAB OCCULT TERMINATORS** unit from your army that is in Strategic Reserves.\n\n**EFFECT:** If it is a **RUBRIC MARINES** unit, until the end of the phase, it has the Deep Strike ability. When your unit is set up on the battlefield using the Deep Strike ability, if it is a **SCARAB OCCULT TERMINATOR** unit it can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is wholly within your army’s Flow of Magic and more than 6\" horizontally away from all enemy models.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** If a **SCARAB OCCULT TERMINATORS** unit is targeted with this Stratagem, it is not eligible to declare a charge in the same turn."
      },
      "Stratagem§Touched by Tzeentch": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
