          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **TZEENTCH MUTANT** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot or declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced."
      },
      "Stratagem§Twisted Mirage": {
        "keywords": {
