          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Charge move.\n\n**TARGET:** One **RUBRIC MARINES** unit from your army within Engagement Range of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, attacks that target your unit with a **S** greater than your unit’s **T** have -1 to **wound rolls**."
      },
