      "Stratagem§The Land Writhes": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **MONSTER MUTANT** unit is **selected to move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **MONSTER MUTANT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has **MOBILE**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Servants Of Change"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Prismatic Displacement": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **INFANTRY/MOUNTED MUTANT** unit is selected to make an **advance/fall back move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **INFANTRY/MOUNTED MUTANT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** - Your unit’s ranged attacks have **[ASSAULT]** until the end of the turn.\n\n- That move does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to shoot/declare a charge**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Servants Of Change"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Temporal Instability": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **INFANTRY/MOUNTED MUTANT** unit is selected to make an **advance/fall back move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **INFANTRY/MOUNTED MUTANT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** In a turn your unit made an **advance/fall-back move**, that move does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to start an action**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Servants Of Change"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Relentless Rebirth": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, when a friendly **INFANTRY/MOUNTED THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit suffers a mortal wound.\n\n**TARGET:** That **INFANTRY/MOUNTED THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has **Feel No Pain 5+** against **mortal wounds**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Ritual Of Regeneration"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Multitudinous Limbs": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **INFANTRY/MOUNTED THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit is selected to make an **advance/fall back move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **INFANTRY/MOUNTED THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** That move does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to start an action**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Ritual Of Regeneration"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Mutagenic Magicks": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **engaged** **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit engaged with your unit. Roll six D6:\n\n- For each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 **mortal wound**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Ritual Of Regeneration"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Ectoplasmic Extrusion": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **SEKHETAR ROBOTS** unit within 12\" of a friendly **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit starts an **action**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **SEKHETAR ROBOTS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** That **action** does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to shoot**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Sekhetar Cohort"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Warp Fields": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **SEKHETAR ROBOTS** unit within 12\" of a friendly **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **SEKHETAR ROBOTS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Ranged attacks that target your unit with a **S** greater than your unit’s **T** have -1 to **wound rolls**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Sekhetar Cohort"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Arcane Venting": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **SEKHETAR ROBOTS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one **objective** your unit is controlling. That **objective** is **secured**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Thousand Sons",
            "Sekhetar Cohort"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
