      "Ability§Impossible Form": {
        "text": "_Psychic_\n\nEach time an attack is made against this **PSYKER** (excluding Psychic Attacks), subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Ability§Treason of Tzeentch": {
        "text": "_Psychic_\n\nAt the start of your opponent’s Shooting phase, select one enemy unit within 24\" of this **PSYKER**. Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [HAZARDOUS] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Time Flux": {
        "text": "_Aura, Psychic_\n\nWhile a friendly Thousand Sons unit is within 6\" of this **PSYKER**, add 2\" to the Move characteristic of models in that unit."
      },
      "Character§Chaos Lord on Disc of Tzeentch": {
