          "traits": [
            "Ability§Cabal of Sorcerers"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Vehicle§Terrax-pattern Termite": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Tzeentch",
            "Chaos"
          ]
        },
        "assets": {
          "traits": [
            "Ability§Combat Doctrines"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Ability§Combat Doctrines": {
        "text": "At the start of your Command phase, you can select one **combat doctrine** listed below. If you do, that **combat doctrine** is active for friendly **ADEPTUS** **ASTARTES** units with this ability until the start of your next Command phase.\n\nASSAULT DOCTRINEWhen this unit is selected to make an **advance move**, that **advance move** does not prevent this unit from being **eligible to declare a charge**.\n\nDEVASTATOR DOCTRINEThis unit’s ranged attacks have **[ASSAULT]**.\n\nTACTICAL DOCTRINEWhen this unit is selected to make a **fall-back move**, that **fall-back move** does not prevent this unit from being **eligible to shoot** and **eligible to declare a charge**.\nUnless otherwise stated:\n\n- You can only select each **combat doctrine** once per battle.\n\n- Only one **combat doctrine** can be active for each unit. If a rule makes a **combat doctrine** active for a unit, any **combat doctrine** previously active for that unit is no longer active for that unit."
      },
